# One proxy per line. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
# Both of these formats are accepted and normalised:
#   user:pass@ip:port
#   ip:port:user:pass
# Authless proxies are also fine:
#   ip:port
#
# Example:
# user123:secretpass@203.0.113.10:8080
# 203.0.113.11:8080:user123:secretpass
# 203.0.113.12:3128
